  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br />Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant</p>",
